        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You only have 1 second. Will you press it... or choke?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942530/extras/c9dbbd919834d25ddba8460eadf09dcf.poster.avif?t=1757341025\" width=418 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942530/extras/c9dbbd919834d25ddba8460eadf09dcf.webm?t=1757341025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;1 Second&quot;</strong> is a fast-paced, hilarious, and insanely addictive reflex game! Each round throws a bizarre new command at you — “Press any key except A”, “Don’t touch anything”, “Click but don’t regret it” — and you have just <strong>1 second</strong> to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss it? <strong>Game Over.</strong><br>Nail it? <strong>Congrats, next level!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a minimalist look, unpredictable commands, and frantic rhythm, <i>&quot;1 Second&quot;</i> is perfect for playing, laughing, and challenging your friends.<br><strong>How many levels can you survive without losing your mind?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random and absurd commands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick reflexes and snap decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean and stylish visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight, fast, and perfect for streaming or short videos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record system and infinite levels</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦 Minimum requirements:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One finger, one second, and all your attention 😅</p>",
